# Units that ship inside the base repo (one per line).  They are never fetched,
# and any "require <unit>" of one of them in a UNIT.deps file is already met.
# sys and atomic are NOT here: they are in the starter list (project NONE) and
# are fetched before compile. repo ships with the base tree.  bin is not a unit:
# it is the empty install directory for programs (~/bin).
repo		# the tools that maintain project.repos and fetch units
